<LVClass LVVersion="13008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.DefaultMenu" Type="Str">BaseReader.mnu</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Base for the Reader class hierarchy. The Reader is capable of reading and writing messages to a remote destination, such as a TCP/IP connection, queue or serial port.

The messages are instances of the BaseMessage class. The message class are responsible for formatting themselves to and from strings.</Property>
